TDC Valheim Installer v0.5.0
Adds first-launch detection for BepInEx.
New installation flow
Run installer and choose Install / Update.
The installer installs the BepInEx bootstrap package.
Launch Valheim normally through Steam and reach the main menu.
Close Valheim.
Run the installer again.
The installer detects `BepInEx\LogOutput.log` and permits the full TDC pack installation.
Future mods should be added to `packages` in manifest.json with a stage other
than `bootstrap`. Only bootstrap packages are installed before BepInEx has
successfully initialized.
The status screen now reports:
BepInEx installed/not installed
BepInEx setup complete/first launch required
Installed TDC version
Repository TDC version
